<title>HONG KONG: Saehan Merchant to set $50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Saehan Merchant to set $50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saehan Merchant Bank has mandated IBJ Asia to arrange a US$50 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>An underwriting group is now being formed.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
